{"id":"3602b7d0a6be1b32","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-oracle-finite-use.md","title":"Finite Oracle Use","display":"thm-oracle-finite-use — Finite Oracle Use","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-oracle-finite-use","aliases":["68-thm-oracle-finite-use"],"display":"thm-oracle-finite-use — Finite Oracle Use","depends_on":["[[68-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§12 final finite-dependence equation, p.43 / PDF 52","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-oracle-finite-use"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-oracle-finite-use</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-oracle-finite-use — Finite Oracle Use"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12 final finite-dependence equation, p.43 / PDF 52"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^A\">\\(C^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 作为 von Neumann 自然数表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,u-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,u-1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A(x)\\simeq y\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(A\\cap u=B\\cap u\\Rightarrow\\varphi_e^B(x)\\simeq y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e^A(x)\\simeq y\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(A\\cap u=B\\cap u\\Rightarrow\\varphi_e^B(x)\\simeq y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §12 末，印刷 p.43 / PDF p.52，有限 oracle 初段决定一个收敛计算。证明：给定停机运行只发生有限次 oracle 读取，取所有查询数的严格上界 u（无查询时 u=0）；A,B 在 u 以下一致，则按执行步数归纳每一步配置相同，最后输出同为 y。这里明确保留“已收敛”前提，不能据此断言发散也由有限初段决定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\varphi_e^A$ 与 $C^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$u$ 作为 von Neumann 自然数表示 $\\{0,\\ldots,u-1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"C^A","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,u-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A(x)\\simeq y\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(A\\cap u=B\\cap u\\Rightarrow\\varphi_e^B(x)\\simeq y).","display":true}],"bytes":1307,"backlinks":[{"id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对应 §12，印刷 pp.39–43 / PDF pp.48–52。原书为每个全函数 oracle 增加读取指令，并对有限 oracle 列表编码；本节点取单个集合的表示函数，并因本目录 χ 约定调整 0/1。确定性给出单值的函数图。阶段图以输入与执行步数双重界定，故有限；A_s 变化时不保证图单调，收敛使用的有限查询见 [[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"fcd2a2bd1b358916","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages]] 唯一确定的阶段数据 $C_s$、$\\mathrm{FMAct}$、$\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}$ 及极限集合 $A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\mathrm{FinInjury}$ 见 [[68-df-finite-injury]]；$\\mathrm{RE}$、$\\le_T$、$\\Phi_e^D$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]、[[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$\\chi_D$ 沿用该 oracle 接口的集合表示函数。有限查询保持使用 [[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"e061a6cb0c6ad653","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{1\\text{-}Generic}$ 见 [[68-df-one-generic-set]]。$\\mathrm{Recursive}$、跳跃 $G'$、$\\equiv_T$、有效并 $\\oplus$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-turing-jump]]、[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]、[[68-df-effective-join]]。oracle 程序及其有限查询性质见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]、[[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-oracle-finite-use|thm-oracle-finite-use — Finite Oracle Use]]"}],"outgoing":["124259d2584af1b6"]}